title: FifthBall
---
<<hideBatsman>>
<<if $selection == "None">>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    Ramu: Time ran out! Quick decisions are crucial in cricket.
<<elseif $selection == "StraightDrivePush" || $selection == "OnDriveNormal">>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    Ramu: Perfect! Yorkers need low shots to dig them out.
<<elseif $selection == "OnDriveAggressive" || $selection == "StraightDriveLofted">>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    Ramu: Captain, Playing aggressive shots on yorkers is fine but will always result in 1 run.
<<elseif $selection == "Leave">>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    Ramu: Dangerous! Never leave a yorker heading for the stumps.
<<else>>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    Ramu: Yorkers are tricky—aim low next time.
<<endif>>
<<hideCharacterImage>>
<<showBatsman>>
<<changeTimerTiming 20>>
<<ballSixthBall>>
===

title: SixthBall
---
<<hideBatsman>>
<<if $selection == "None">>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    <<unhideBallerCard>>
    Ramu: Don't let the timer pressure you. Stay focused.
<<elseif $selection == "SweepNormal" || $selection == "SweepAggressive">>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    Ramu: Captain, playing sweep against good length deliveries is always risky. Be careful.
<<elseif $selection == "StraightDrivePush" || $selection == "CoverDriveNormal">>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    Ramu: Good choice—playing straight is safe against spin.
<<elseif $selection == "Leave">>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    Ramu: Smart—the ball was safe to leave.
<<else>>
    <<resetToOriginalPresets>>
    <<moveDialogue top>>
    <<showCharacterImage center>>
    Ramu: Against spin, consider sweep shots or careful defense.
<<endif>>
<<hideCharacterImage>>
<<showBatsman>>
<<ballSeventhBall>>
